  --------------------------------------------------

  n=2: max H = 1, achieved by 2 labeled tournaments (100.00%)
  n=3: max H = 3, achieved by 2 labeled tournaments (25.00%)
  n=4: max H = 5, achieved by 24 labeled tournaments (37.50%)
  n=5: max H = 15, achieved by 64 labeled tournaments (6.25%)
